          ],
          "content": "7. Why are hollow bricks used to construct the outer walls of houses in hot regions?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.267,
            0.126,
            0.883,
            0.164
          ],
          "content": "8. Explain how large water bodies prevent extreme temperature in areas around them."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.266,
            0.168,
            0.883,
            0.207
          ],
          "content": "9. Explain how water seeps through the surface of the Earth and gets stored as groundwater."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.257,
            0.21,
            0.883,
            0.25
          ],
          "content": "10. The water cycle helps in the redistribution and replenishment of water on the Earth. Justify the statement."
